  <metadata>
    <id>Fanex.Data.Repository</id>
    <version>1.0.1</version>
    <title>Fanex.Data.Repository</title>
    <authors>jason.ly</authors>
    <owners>jason.ly</owners>
    <projectUrl>https://gitlab.nexcel.vn/infrastructure/fanex-data</projectUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description>Provide some common methods of a data access layer, using Fanex.Data as the under Micro-ORM.</description>
    <summary>Provide some common methods of a data access layer, using Fanex.Data as the under Micro-ORM.</summary>
    <releaseNotes>New methods added:
- CriteriaBase:
  + bool IsInvalid()
- DynamicRepository:
  + Tuple&lt;IEnumerable&lt;TFirst&gt;, IEnumerable&lt;TSecond&gt;&gt; FetchMultiple&lt;TFirst, TSecond&gt;(ICriteria criteria)
  + Tuple&lt;IEnumerable&lt;TFirst&gt;, IEnumerable&lt;TSecond&gt;, IEnumerable&lt;TThird&gt;&gt; FetchMultiple&lt;TFirst, TSecond, TThird&gt;(ICriteria criteria)
  + IEnumerable&lt;object&gt;[] FetchMultiple(ICriteria criteria, Type[] mappingTypes)
  + Task&lt;Tuple&lt;IEnumerable&lt;TFirst&gt;, IEnumerable&lt;TSecond&gt;&gt;&gt; FetchMultipleAsync&lt;TFirst, TSecond&gt;(ICriteria criteria)
  + Task&lt;Tuple&lt;IEnumerable&lt;TFirst&gt;, IEnumerable&lt;TSecond&gt;, IEnumerable&lt;TThird&gt;&gt;&gt; FetchMultipleAsync&lt;TFirst, TSecond, TThird&gt;(ICriteria criteria)
  + Task&lt;IEnumerable&lt;object&gt;[]&gt; FetchMultipleAsync(ICriteria criteria, Type[] mappingTypes)</releaseNotes>
